   "A": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT authorizing the village of Round Lake, in the town of Malta and the\ncounty of Saratoga, to extend the lease of certain park lands in such village",
    "basePrintNo": "S9068",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S9068-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "",
    "lawSection": "Parks",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S9068A\n\nSPONSOR: TEDISCO\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act authorizing the village of Round Lake, in the town of Malta and\nthe county of Saratoga, to extend the lease of certain park lands in\nsuch village\n\n \nPURPOSE OR GENERAL IDEA OF BILL:\n\nTo extend the term of the lease of certain park lands by the village of\nRound Lake in the town of Malta.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1. The village of Round Lake, in the town of Malta, county of\nSaratoga, is hereby authorized and empowered to extend the terms of a\nlease between the village and Crown Atlantic Company LLC dated September\n19, 1997 that was authorized by chapter 542 of the laws of 1997, on the\nlands described in chapter 542 of the laws of 1997, for up to an addi-\ntional thirty years from the date of its expiration.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill extends the duration for the Village of Round Lake's authority\nto lease parkland for a cell tower. This authorization dates back to the\nyear 1997.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n03/22/11: S.2152 PASSED SENATE\n\n08/03/11: S.2152 SIGNED CHAP.324\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the State.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take January 1, 2028\n",
